'''Basic fireworks''' are items which can be purchased from [[Hildir]] for {{Item Link|Coins|50}} each. This item will be in the merchant's assortment only after returning [[Hildir's bronze chest]].

== Usage ==
All fireworks can be used on an open fire to launch high into the air and explode. While the ''Basic fireworks'' can be used for a white explosion, it is also used to craft the other [[Fireworks]].
