'''Moose Saddle''' is a craftable item that grants the ability to ride tamed [[Moose]].

== Usage ==
To attach it, put the saddle on the hotbar, then activate it while aiming at a tamed [[Moose]]. The saddle can then be mounted by pressing the "Use" key (E by default). The saddle can be removed from the Moose by pressing Left-Shift + E.

If a saddled Moose dies, the saddle drops on the ground. A dropped saddle floats in water.

== Recipe ==
The Moose Saddle can be crafted at a level 2 [[Black Forge]] with:
* {{Item link|Bloodgold|4}}
* {{Item link|Seal Pelt|5}}
* {{Item link|Timberwood|5}}
* {{Item link|Linen Thread|15}}

